      ],
      "source": "https://coalcampusa.com/westpa/pittsburgh/muse/muse.htm",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Muse Italian Club stands as a reminder of the many Italian immigrants who worked in local mines and mills.",
