      ],
      "source": "https://coalcampusa.com/westpa/pittsburgh/muse/muse.htm",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "At the heart of the community, the former company store still marks where miners once bought their daily supplies.",
